# Mode Spectrum Distribution Query
# ARS 25种模式分布统计

```dataview
TABLE project_name, ars_mode, stage, created
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
SORT ars_mode ASC, project_name ASC
```

## 模式使用统计

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  ars_mode AS "ARS Mode",
  length(rows) AS "Project Count"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
GROUP BY ars_mode
SORT "Project Count" DESC
```

## 模式-阶段矩阵

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  ars_mode AS "Mode",
  filter(rows.stage, (s) => s = "1-RESEARCH") AS "Research",
  filter(rows.stage, (s) => s = "2-WRITE") AS "Write",
  filter(rows.stage, (s) => s = "3-REVIEW") AS "Review",
  filter(rows.stage, (s) => s = "4-REVISE") AS "Revise",
  filter(rows.stage, (s) => s = "5-FINALIZE") AS "Finalize"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "material-passport"
GROUP BY ars_mode
```

## 推荐下一模式

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  "Current Mode" AS "Current Mode",
  "Next Mode" AS "Recommended Next",
  "Trigger" AS "When to Use"
FROM ""
WHERE contains(rows.ars_mode, "deep-research full")
FLATTEN ["academic-paper plan", "academic-paper full"] AS next_mode
GROUP BY next_mode
```